# Model preference (quality + cost)

- Prefer **Grok** for implementation (feature, fix, explore, swarm). Pick Grok in the Cursor chat model dropdown for the parent session.
- Use **Claude** (Fable) only for judgment, review, synthesizer, Thai/prose, or hardest tasks — or when Grok clearly fails.
- Do **not** switch to GPT or Opus unless the user asks.
- Keep tool loops lean. If a harder model is needed, say so briefly and wait for user OK before assuming extra API spend.
